 gameplay, where every misstep and hasty decision can prove fatal. Utilize melee weapons, firearms, and special skills. With stunning graphics and immersive sound design, Devil’s Island creates an atmosphere of post-apocalyptic horror and tension. It’s a must-play for fans of zombies, survival, and Anunnaki lore, promising hours of thrilling gameplay.", "short_description": "In this horror zombie survival game, set in a post-apocalyptic taiga forest, players must grapple with nature while managing hunger, thirst, health, and resources. They can collect mushrooms, craft items and weapons, cook raw meat, and battle various enemies.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Japanese, Polish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897480/header.jpg?t=1768858960", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897480/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768858960", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897480/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768858960", "website": "https://devilsislandgame.online", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64Bit, Windows 8 64Bit, Windows 10 64Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 10 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 970 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64Bit, Windows 8 64Bit, Windows 10 64Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 G